content.text:
Part 4: UI updates, HUD, target chip, render.

`updateHud(force=false)`:
```
  updateHud(force = false) {
    const d=this.dom;
    const activeTeam=this.turnTeam;
    // pips
    const sig = this.worms.map(w=>`${w.team}${w.alive?1:0}${Math.ceil(w.health)}${w===this.active?1:0}`).join('|');
    if (force || sig !== this.pipSig) { ... build html; this.pipSig=sig; }
    ...
  }
```
Building pips innerHTML helper method `pipHTML(team)`.

Dead pip: include dead ones with class dead and 0.

Team mats: update `youMats` b.
Turn label: map.
`this.dom.turnPanel` exists; classList.toggle('enemy', ...). Add urgent when timer<=10 and state aim.
Timer text: state aim/enemy/flying/settle ? Math.ceil(timer) : '--'; For menu '--'. Use `this.timer`.
Wind: arrow transform, text.
Weapons:
```
this.weaponButtons.forEach((btn,i)=>{
 const wp=WEAPONS[i]; const w=this.active;
 const ammo = w ? w.ammo[wp.id] : wp.ammo;
 const finite = Number.isFinite(ammo);
 btn.classList.toggle('active', i===selectedWeapon && state!=='over');
 btn.classList.toggle('empty', finite && ammo<=0);
 btn.querySelector('.weapon-ammo').textContent = finite ? ammo : '∞';
 btn.disabled = this.state !== 'aim';
})
```
Disabling weapon buttons when enemy turn; but CSS disabled? no style; add maybe. fine.

Build toggle:
```
d.buildToggle.classList.toggle('active', this.buildMode);
d.buildToggle.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(this.buildMode));
d.buildPalette.classList.toggle('open', this.buildMode);
d.buildPalette.setAttribute('aria-hidden', String(!this.buildMode));
```
Build chips:
```
const teamMats = this.teams[0].mats;
for chip: const cfg=BUILDS[chip.dataset.build]; chip.classList.toggle('active', ...); chip.disabled = state!=='aim'||teamMats<cfg.cost||buildsUsed>=BUILD_LIMIT;
```
Ramp chip label: contains text; we can set innerHTML each update? Only if rampDir changed. Add `this.rampHTML` signature.
```
if (this.rampDir !== this.lastRampDir) { update chip innerHTML }
```
Simplify set text of ramp chip using innerHTML: `<span class="piece-icon ramp"></span>RAMP ${this.rampDir===1?'→':'←'} <b>25</b>`. Do whenever changed.

Power:
```
d.powerValue.textContent = `${Math.round(this.aim.power)}%`;
if (!this.sliderActive) d.powerSlider.value = String(Math.round(this.aim.power));
```
Actually while dragging slider, this.aim.power changes from input; updating value to same value fine. Keep simple always set.

Fire disabled: `this.state !== 'aim' || !this.active`. `d.fireBtn.disabled=...`.

Target chip handled separately.

`updateTargetChip`:
```
const chip = d.targetChip;
if (state!=='aim' || !active) hide
const enemies=...; if none hide
const nearest = enemies.reduce...
const sx=(nearest.x - camX)*scale;
if (sx>=0 && sx<=cw) hide else show
arrow rotate sx<0?180:0; text=`RIVAL ${Math.round(dist(active,nearest)/6)}m`
```
The chip's arrow is '→'; rotate 180 for left.
Maybe only show if offscreen by 40px. Use < 30 or > cw-30.

`render()`, draw. 
```
  render() {
    this.computeView();
    const {cw,ch,dpr,scale}=this.view;
    const ctx=this.ctx;
    ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);
    ctx.clearRect(0,0,cw,ch);
    drawScreenSky(ctx,this);
    const sx=(Math.random()-0.5)*this.shake;
    const sy=(Math.random()-0.5)*this.shake;
    ctx.save();
    ctx.translate(-this.camX*scale+sx, -this.camY*scale+sy);
    ctx.scale(scale,scale);
    drawWorldBackground(ctx,this);
    this.terrain.draw(ctx);
    for (const b of this.buildings) drawBuilding(ctx,this,b);
    for (const l of this.llamas) drawLlama(ctx,this,l);
    if (this.buildMode && this.state==='aim') {
      drawRangeRing(ctx,this);
      const bp=this.currentBuildPreview();
      if (bp) drawBuildGhost(ctx,this,bp);
    }
    if ((this.state==='aim'||this.state==='enemy') && this.active && this.active.alive && !this.buildMode) {
      const preview=simulateTrajectory(this,this.active,this.aim.angle,this.aim.power,WEAPONS[this.selectedWeapon],true);
      drawAimPreview(ctx,this,preview, this.state==='enemy'?0.7:1);
    }
    for (const w of this.worms) drawWorm(ctx,this,w);
    for (const d of this.deadWorms) drawDeadWorm(ctx,this,d);
    for (const p of this.projectiles) drawProjectile(ctx,this,p);
    drawParticles(ctx,this);
    drawTexts(ctx,this);
    drawWindStreaks(ctx,this);
    ctx.restore();
    drawScreenOverlay(ctx,this);
  }
```
Selected weapon could be out of ammo; preview still shows. Fine.

`currentBuildPreview()`:
```
if (!this.active || state!=='aim') return null;
let px,py;
if (this.pointer) {px=this.pointer.x;py=this.pointer.y}
else { const dir=this.active.team===0?1:-1; px=this.active.x+dir*104; py=this.active.y-20; }
return computePlacement(this,this.buildType,px,py,0)
```
But pointer tracks mouse over HUD too; if pointer over UI, build preview might go weird, not a big deal. Set pointer null on pointerleave.

Render menu: active null, terrain/worms drawn idle. Aim preview skipped. Good.

`drawRangeRing` requires g.active; fine.

Need `this.terrain` etc.

Also on menu, draw worms with isActive false; works.

`updateHud` when menu: active null; pips show both teams full. HUD hidden but fine. `turnPanel` etc.

`startMatch` hide overlays; game over overlay hidden. Also reset `this.lastTime`? no.

Potential: RAF loop keeps running while menu; time advances and clouds. Good.

Pips helper:
```
  wormPipHTML(team) {
    return this.worms.filter(w=>w.team===team).map(w=>{
      const hp=Math.max(0,Math.ceil(w.health));
      const cls=['worm-pip']; if (this.active===w && w.alive) cls.push('active'); if(!w.alive) cls.push('dead'); if(hp<=30) cls.push('crit'); else if(hp<=60) cls.push('low');
      return `<div class="${cls.join(' ')}">...`;
    }).join('')
  }
```
Pip signature must include build? no.

Mats text uses b child; set if changed (fine).

Now `updateHud` also set mats at top. Use `Math.floor`.

`this.dom.enemyMats` etc.

Timer urgent class; add to timerPill.

Turn panel class: `enemy` when `turnTeam===1 && state!=='menu' && state!=='over'`; urgent when timer<=10 and (aim/enemy).

`turnLabel`: 
```
const labels={menu:'GET READY',aim:'YOUR TURN',enemy:'RIVAL TURN',flying:'INCOMING!',settle:'IMPACT',over:'MATCH OVER'};
```
For flying, if turnTeam===1 show 'RIVAL SHOT'. Fine.

`windText` = Math.abs(Math.round(wind/10)).toString(); title `Wind ${...}`.

Let's append part 4.

input.newString:
  wormPipHTML(team) {
    return this.worms.filter((w) => w.team === team).map((w) => {
      const hp = Math.max(0, Math.ceil(w.health));
      const cls = ['worm-pip'];
      if (this.active === w && w.alive) cls.push('active');
      if (!w.alive) cls.push('dead');
      else if (hp <= 30) cls.push('crit');
      else if (hp <= 60) cls.push('low');
      return `<div class="${cls.join(' ')}">
        <div class="worm-pip-top"><span>${w.name}</span><span>${w.alive ? hp : '—'}</span></div>
        <div class="worm-hp"><i style="width:${Math.max(0, hp)}%"></i></div>
      </div>`;
    }).join('');
  }

  updateHud(force = false) {
    const d = this.dom;
    const sig = this.worms.map((w) => `${w.team}${w.alive ? 1 : 0}${Math.ceil(w.health)}${w === this.active ? 1 : 0}`).join('|');
    if (force || sig !== this.pipSig) {
      d.youWorms.innerHTML = this.wormPipHTML(0);
      d.enemyWorms.innerHTML = this.wormPipHTML(1);
      this.pipSig = sig;
    }

    d.youMats.querySelector('b').textContent = Math.floor(this.teams[0].mats);
    d.enemyMats.querySelector('b').textContent = Math.floor(this.teams[1].mats);

    const labels = {
      menu: 'GET READY', aim: 'YOUR TURN', enemy: 'RIVAL TURN',
      flying: 'INCOMING!', settle: 'IMPACT!', over: 'MATCH OVER',
    };
    d.turnLabel.textContent = labels[this.state] || 'READY';
    d.turnPanel.classList.toggle('enemy', this.turnTeam === 1 && this.state !== 'menu' && this.state !== 'over');
    d.turnPanel.classList.toggle('urgent', this.timer <= 10 && (this.state === 'aim' || this.state === 'enemy'));

    d.windArrow.style.transform = this.wind < 0 ? 'rotate(180deg)' : 'rotate(0deg)';
    d.windText.textContent = `${Math.abs(Math.round(this.wind / 10))}`;
    d.windPill.title = `Wind pushes shots ${this.wind < 0 ? 'left' : 'right'} at ${Math.abs(Math.round(this.wind / 10))} m/s`;

    const showTimer = this.state === 'aim' || this.state === 'enemy' || this.state === 'flying' || this.state === 'settle';
    d.timerText.textContent = showTimer ? `${Math.max(0, Math.ceil(this.timer))}` : '—';
    d.timerPill.classList.toggle('urgent', showTimer && this.timer <= 10);

    this.weaponButtons.forEach((btn, i) => {
      const wp = WEAPONS[i];
      const w = this.active;
      const ammo = w ? (w.ammo[wp.id] ?? 0) : wp.ammo;
      const finite = Number.isFinite(ammo);
      btn.classList.toggle('active', i === this.selectedWeapon && this.state !== 'over');
      btn.classList.toggle('empty', finite && ammo <= 0);
      btn.querySelector('.weapon-ammo').textContent = finite ? `${ammo}` : '∞';
      btn.disabled = this.state !== 'aim';
    });

    const mats = this.teams[0].mats;
    d.buildToggle.classList.toggle('active', this.buildMode);
    d.buildToggle.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(this.buildMode));
    d.buildPalette.classList.toggle('open', this.buildMode);
    d.buildPalette.setAttribute('aria-hidden', String(!this.buildMode));
    for (const chip of d.buildChips) {
      const type = chip.dataset.build;
      const cfg = BUILDS[type];
      chip.classList.toggle('active', this.buildType === type);
      chip.disabled = this.state !== 'aim' || mats < cfg.cost || this.buildsUsed >= BUILD_LIMIT;
      if (type === 'ramp' && this.lastRampDir !== this.rampDir) {
        chip.innerHTML = `<span class="piece-icon ramp"></span>RAMP ${this.rampDir === 1 ? '↗' : '↖'} <b>${cfg.cost}</b>`;
      }
    }
    this.lastRampDir = this.rampDir;

    d.powerValue.textContent = `${Math.round(this.aim.power)}%`;
    if (!this.sliderActive) d.powerSlider.value = `${Math.round(this.aim.power)}`;
    d.fireBtn.disabled = this.state !== 'aim' || !this.active;
  }

  updateTargetChip() {
    const chip = this.dom.targetChip;
    if (this.state !== 'aim' || !this.active || !this.active.alive) {
      chip.classList.add('is-hidden');
      return;
    }
    const enemies = this.worms.filter((w) => w.team !== this.active.team && w.alive);
    if (!enemies.length) { chip.classList.add('is-hidden'); return; }
    const nearest = enemies.reduce((a, b) => (dist(a.x, a.y, this.active.x, this.active.y) < dist(b.x, b.y, this.active.x, this.active.y) ? a : b));
    const sx = (nearest.x - this.camX) * this.view.scale;
    const off = sx < 24 || sx > this.view.cw - 24;
    if (!off) {
      chip.classList.add('is-hidden');
      return;
    }
    chip.classList.remove('is-hidden');
    this.dom.targetArrow.style.transform = sx < 0 ? 'rotate(180deg)' : 'rotate(0deg)';
    this.dom.targetText.textContent = `RIVAL ${Math.round(dist(this.active.x, this.active.y, nearest.x, nearest.y) / 6)}m`;
  }

  currentBuildPreview() {
    if (!this.active || this.state !== 'aim') return null;
    let px;
    let py;
    if (this.pointer) {
      px = this.pointer.x;
      py = this.pointer.y;
    } else {
      px = this.active.x + 108;
      py = this.active.y - 18;
    }
    return computePlacement(this, this.buildType, px, py, 0);
  }

  render() {
    this.computeView();
    const { cw, ch, dpr, scale } = this.view;
    const ctx = this.ctx;
    ctx.setTransform(dpr, 0, 0, dpr, 0, 0);
    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, cw, ch);
    drawScreenSky(ctx, this);

    const shakeX = (Math.random() - 0.5) * this.shake;
    const shakeY = (Math.random() - 0.5) * this.shake;
    ctx.save();
    ctx.translate(-this.camX * scale + shakeX, -this.camY * scale + shakeY);
    ctx.scale(scale, scale);

    drawWorldBackground(ctx, this);
    this.terrain.draw(ctx);

    for (const b of this.buildings) drawBuilding(ctx, this, b);
    for (const l of this.llamas) drawLlama(ctx, this, l);

    if (this.buildMode && this.state === 'aim') {
      drawRangeRing(ctx, this);
      const bp = this.currentBuildPreview();
      if (bp) drawBuildGhost(ctx, this, bp);
    }

    if ((this.state === 'aim' || this.state === 'enemy') && this.active && this.active.alive && !this.buildMode) {
      const preview = simulateTrajectory(this, this.active, this.aim.angle, this.aim.power, WEAPONS[this.selectedWeapon], true);
      drawAimPreview(ctx, this, preview, this.state === 'enemy' ? 0.65 : 1);
    }

    for (const w of this.worms) drawWorm(ctx, this, w);
    for (const d of this.deadWorms) drawDeadWorm(ctx, this, d);
    for (const p of this.projectiles) drawProjectile(ctx, this, p);
    drawParticles(ctx, this);
    drawTexts(ctx, this);
    drawWindStreaks(ctx, this);

    ctx.restore();
    drawScreenOverlay(ctx, this);
  }

  // __PART5__
}

